00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,684
It turns out that the most fragrant treasure is not the treasure, but the airdrop. When exchanging treasures, only the No. 8 coin will be red.

2
00:00:04,684 --> 00:00:09,837
The rest of the new empty treasure maps turned out to be just a small amount of gold when exchanged. However, airdrops usually contain multiple items.

3
00:00:09,837 --> 00:00:13,740
Xiao Jin Big Red is randomly selected, and two airdrops are randomly selected. If one is in the administration building,

4
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:18,581
The other will fall in the outlying visitor center or substation. This is the airdrop location of Dam Zero,

5
00:00:18,581 --> 00:00:22,172
This is the airdrop position of Chang Gong, this is for eight lessons, this is for aerospace.

6
00:00:22,172 --> 00:00:26,700
If you see an airdrop and don’t know where it landed, just mark the airdrop and you’ll know where it landed.

7
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:31,693
Airdrops will drop between two and five minutes after the start, and there will be a system prompt to remind players when they drop.

8
00:00:31,693 --> 00:00:35,880
It’s not too late to look up when prompted, but be sure to pay attention to whether there is anyone around the airdrop.
